1
00:01:42,840 --> 00:01:43,680
As for those batches of goods,

2
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,519
Mr. Jiang has found ready buyers.

3
00:01:45,840 --> 00:01:46,480
Tony,

4
00:01:47,159 --> 00:01:48,319
stick with Mr. Jiang for now

5
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:49,480
and help him out.

6
00:01:50,359 --> 00:01:52,840
Xiao Zhuang just needs to clear customs.

7
00:01:53,719 --> 00:01:55,120
We'll follow your arrangements, sir.

8
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:57,120
By the way,

9
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:59,120
I heard you arrived in Country M yesterday

10
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,560
and were immediately ambushed.

11
00:02:05,159 --> 00:02:06,959
It was Piyazi.

12
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:11,319
Even if you used to be Piyazi's downline,

13
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:12,840
and changed bosses,

14
00:02:14,360 --> 00:02:16,680
they shouldn't be so ruthless

15
00:02:17,479 --> 00:02:18,759
as to take your life, right?

16
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:23,240
When we went to Jiangyang this time,

17
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,840
we actually wanted to contact

18
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:26,560
a buyer named Cheng Weimin.

19
00:02:27,479 --> 00:02:28,560
Who would have thought

20
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:29,759
that this Cheng Weimin

21
00:02:29,759 --> 00:02:32,120
turned out to be the business partner of

22
00:02:32,120 --> 00:02:33,599
Piyazi's brother, Xiang Nan.

23
00:02:34,080 --> 00:02:36,800
So, to fight over this buyer,

24
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:39,719
we had a clash with Xiang Nan.

25
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:43,719
So you took out Xiang Nan?

26
00:02:44,680 --> 00:02:46,120
We had no choice.

27
00:02:48,759 --> 00:02:50,599
Piyazi won't let this go.

28
00:02:50,879 --> 00:02:52,240
So whatever you do lately,

29
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,879
you must be extremely careful.

30
00:02:57,240 --> 00:03:00,039
I heard Four-Legged Snake took a woman yesterday.

31
00:03:01,159 --> 00:03:02,680
I wonder if she's one of yours.

32
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:07,360
Do you need our help with anything?

33
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:08,840
As for that woman,

34
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,319
I don't know much about her.

35
00:03:11,159 --> 00:03:12,879
She might be my brother's woman.

36
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:15,599
My brother is gone,

37
00:03:16,120 --> 00:03:17,560
so this woman doesn't matter.

38
00:03:23,759 --> 00:03:25,120
Right now, none of us knows

39
00:03:25,120 --> 00:03:26,719
what Piyazi's next move will be.

40
00:03:27,080 --> 00:03:29,879
All of you, keep a low profile for now.

41
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:32,719
Understood, sir.

42
00:03:33,199 --> 00:03:34,599
In that case, we'll take our leave.

43
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:38,560
Goodbye, Mr. Theerade.

44
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:52,159
Sir, are you still

45
00:03:52,159 --> 00:03:53,560
a bit suspicious of these guys?

46
00:03:56,039 --> 00:03:57,560
Ma Jingrong's brother arrived in Country M

47
00:03:57,639 --> 00:04:00,080
and was immediately tailed by the police.

48
00:04:00,520 --> 00:04:01,400
I think

49
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:06,039
this might not be that simple.

50
00:04:21,399 --> 00:04:22,120
Let me ask you.

51
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:24,199
What's your connection to Li Qiang?

52
00:04:24,600 --> 00:04:26,720
Tell me, and I'll let you go.

53
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,519
I already told you.

54
00:04:30,560 --> 00:04:31,920
He took me hostage and brought me here.

55
00:04:32,480 --> 00:04:33,759
All I know is that he's a drug dealer.

56
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,959
Do you take me for a fool?

57
00:04:36,279 --> 00:04:37,399
You have nothing to do with him,

58
00:04:37,519 --> 00:04:38,759
yet he risked his life to save you?

59
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,000
He's a lunatic.

60
00:04:40,800 --> 00:04:42,360
He said he likes me.

61
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:43,680
But in my heart,

62
00:04:44,319 --> 00:04:45,639
there's only hate. Nothing else.

63
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:48,160
You hate him, but he saves you?

64
00:04:48,279 --> 00:04:49,160
Who'd believe that?

65
00:04:50,000 --> 00:04:50,560
Brother Si,

66
00:04:51,959 --> 00:04:54,920
I don't think she's lying.

67
00:04:57,199 --> 00:04:57,759
Brother,

68
00:04:58,600 --> 00:05:01,720
you didn't just see her pretty face

69
00:05:01,959 --> 00:05:03,519
and fall for her, did you?

70
00:05:04,040 --> 00:05:04,600
Brother Dong,

71
00:05:04,680 --> 00:05:06,040
Li Qiang's phone has been decrypted.

72
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:07,199
Take a look.

73
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,319
How interesting.

74
00:05:23,480 --> 00:05:25,920
Really interesting.

75
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:31,560
You're...

76
00:05:32,480 --> 00:05:34,319
a cop's woman.

77
00:05:38,120 --> 00:05:39,040
Familiar, right?

78
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,160
Your boyfriend?

79
00:05:45,160 --> 00:05:46,079
Silence means yes.

80
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,920
Bring this cop over here.

81
00:05:54,920 --> 00:05:56,399
Theerade has always been cautious.

82
00:05:56,839 --> 00:05:58,879
He won't rashly meet with Captain Lu.

83
00:05:59,120 --> 00:06:00,639
Besides, once Li Qiang reached Country M,

84
00:06:00,720 --> 00:06:02,079
he was targeted by the police.

85
00:06:02,279 --> 00:06:03,720
This is a critical time.

86
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:04,759
You can't make any reckless moves.

87
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:06,199
Just do as they say.

88
00:06:06,439 --> 00:06:07,000
All right?

89
00:06:08,319 --> 00:06:09,639
This Theerade

90
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,160
is being watched closely by

91
00:06:11,319 --> 00:06:13,120
The Four Great Families and Piyazi.

92
00:06:13,399 --> 00:06:15,360
But he's still a drug dealer.

93
00:06:15,639 --> 00:06:16,920
As long as his goods won't sell,

94
00:06:17,279 --> 00:06:20,000
he'll definitely seek out Shen Xinru.

95
00:06:21,600 --> 00:06:23,720
If we bust Theerade's current

96
00:06:23,800 --> 00:06:24,519
distribution channels,

97
00:06:25,079 --> 00:06:26,560
he definitely won't be able to sit still.

98
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:30,199
So you mean,

99
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:32,439
before arresting Theerade,

100
00:06:32,639 --> 00:06:35,040
we bust Jiang Liye's faction first?

101
00:06:35,279 --> 00:06:36,839
To conceal

102
00:06:36,879 --> 00:06:37,839
his identity as a drug lord,

103
00:06:38,279 --> 00:06:39,959
aside from making major decisions,

104
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,600
Theerade leaves all other drug trafficking

105
00:06:41,839 --> 00:06:43,160
entirely to Jiang Liye.

106
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:45,120
If we don't eliminate Jiang Liye,

107
00:06:45,720 --> 00:06:48,279
it will be hard to expose Theerade.

108
00:06:48,480 --> 00:06:48,839
Here's the plan.

109
00:06:49,800 --> 00:06:51,920
You only have two things to do right now.

110
00:06:52,560 --> 00:06:54,319
Uncover all of Jiang Liye's downlines.

111
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,480
Monitor all of Jiang Liye's movements.

112
00:06:56,959 --> 00:06:59,160
Secure evidence of all his crimes ASAP.

113
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:05,519
Tony has been working for Jiang Liye.

114
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,639
As for monitoring Jiang Liye,

115
00:07:07,519 --> 00:07:09,000
just leave it to Tony.

116
00:07:10,839 --> 00:07:11,360
I...

117
00:07:11,519 --> 00:07:12,040
Come on.

118
00:07:12,279 --> 00:07:13,079
It's settled.

119
00:07:15,319 --> 00:07:15,839
Relax.

120
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:17,079
Something this important

121
00:07:17,600 --> 00:07:18,920
can't be left to you alone.

122
00:07:19,279 --> 00:07:20,519
If you run into any danger,

123
00:07:20,600 --> 00:07:21,680
as your partner,

124
00:07:21,839 --> 00:07:23,720
I'll come to your rescue right away.

125
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,920
That's a promise, then.

126
00:07:26,439 --> 00:07:28,439
How is Tian Xin doing now?

127
00:07:30,240 --> 00:07:31,639
Any news from over there?

128
00:07:32,079 --> 00:07:33,959
We got word yesterday afternoon

129
00:07:34,120 --> 00:07:37,319
that Four-Legged Snake took Tian Xin

130
00:07:37,600 --> 00:07:39,920
to Jiechan State. No news since then.

131
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:41,480
Piyazi's base

132
00:07:41,519 --> 00:07:43,040
has a communications surveillance system.

133
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:45,399
Wei Kai probably hasn't found a chance

134
00:07:45,399 --> 00:07:46,240
to send us a message yet.

135
00:07:46,639 --> 00:07:48,759
If Piyazi discovers Tian Xin's true identity,

136
00:07:49,199 --> 00:07:50,639
she's as good as dead.

137
00:07:50,879 --> 00:07:51,399
If that's the case,

138
00:07:51,399 --> 00:07:52,759
Li Xiao must be worried sick.

139
00:07:54,079 --> 00:07:54,519
By the way,

140
00:07:55,680 --> 00:07:56,759
how is Li Xiao doing lately?

141
00:07:59,639 --> 00:08:02,439
On the way to rescue Du Guangming,

142
00:08:03,040 --> 00:08:04,759
Li Xiao lost contact with the squad.

143
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,279
We suspect...

144
00:08:10,279 --> 00:08:11,279
he might have been killed in action.

145
00:08:15,079 --> 00:08:15,839
Let me explain.

146
00:08:16,319 --> 00:08:17,399
It's just my guess—

147
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:18,560
How do you do your job?

148
00:08:19,199 --> 00:08:20,519
You're Li Xiao's liaison officer!

149
00:08:20,800 --> 00:08:22,480
You don't even know where he is?

150
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,720
Nothing could have happened to Li Xiao!

151
00:08:25,879 --> 00:08:26,920
He's very capable.

152
00:08:26,959 --> 00:08:27,879
Definitely not.

153
00:08:47,399 --> 00:08:48,399
You're in luck, kid.

154
00:08:48,559 --> 00:08:49,720
Your woman's here to see you.

155
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:06,799
Li Xiao!

156
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:07,639
Li Xiao!

157
00:09:09,399 --> 00:09:09,799
What are you doing?

158
00:09:09,799 --> 00:09:10,519
Let me go!

159
00:09:10,879 --> 00:09:12,840
A family reunion. Having some intimacy.

160
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:13,320
Let go!

161
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:16,120
Li Xiao!

162
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:20,120
Don't be afraid. I'll protect you.

163
00:09:21,519 --> 00:09:21,919
A cop.

164
00:09:22,919 --> 00:09:24,840
Did you really think you could

165
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,360
take your woman away from me?

166
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:32,519
A cop's woman...

167
00:09:32,519 --> 00:09:35,960
in the hands of a petty dealer like Li Qiang.

168
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:38,799
Doesn't matter.

169
00:09:38,960 --> 00:09:40,000
Nor do I care.

170
00:09:40,159 --> 00:09:41,399
That's your business, after all.

171
00:09:42,639 --> 00:09:44,840
All I care about is how the police

172
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:45,960
plan to deal with me.

173
00:09:47,440 --> 00:09:49,080
We only came to rescue Professor Du.

174
00:09:50,159 --> 00:09:50,960
Other than that,

175
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,320
there is nothing else.

176
00:09:54,960 --> 00:09:56,279
Then how am I supposed to help you?

177
00:09:56,639 --> 00:09:59,039
I thought if you told me everything,

178
00:09:59,879 --> 00:10:01,279
you could take your woman

179
00:10:01,279 --> 00:10:02,200
and walk out of here.

180
00:10:02,240 --> 00:10:05,039
Maybe I'd even see you off myself.

181
00:10:05,440 --> 00:10:07,159
Why throw away the chance?

182
00:10:09,320 --> 00:10:09,799
Don't!

183
00:10:10,399 --> 00:10:11,200
Don't shoot!

184
00:10:11,240 --> 00:10:13,360
We're in Country M just to rescue Professor Du.

185
00:10:13,559 --> 00:10:15,080
Any plan in our task force targeting you

186
00:10:15,360 --> 00:10:16,360
simply doesn't exist.

187
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:17,600
Then my brother in Jiangcheng...

188
00:10:17,759 --> 00:10:19,120
Why was he cornered by the police?

189
00:10:19,279 --> 00:10:20,919
He was in Jiangyang. That's the Chinese police!

190
00:10:21,159 --> 00:10:22,080
But when it comes to Jiechan State,

191
00:10:22,159 --> 00:10:23,519
it's really not that easy!

192
00:10:23,559 --> 00:10:25,720
The last raid in Jiechan State was a multinational operation!

193
00:10:25,799 --> 00:10:27,120
And you still claim there's no plan?

194
00:10:29,399 --> 00:10:30,759
If you don't believe me,

195
00:10:32,200 --> 00:10:33,519
just kill me.

196
00:10:33,759 --> 00:10:35,240
But please let her go.

197
00:10:39,039 --> 00:10:40,120
I'm begging you.

198
00:10:40,799 --> 00:10:41,879
Let her go.

199
00:10:43,279 --> 00:10:44,080
Don't!

200
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:49,039
Please, I beg you, let her go!

201
00:10:49,039 --> 00:10:49,639
Just kill me.

202
00:10:50,039 --> 00:10:51,120
Kill me! Kill me instead!

203
00:10:51,159 --> 00:10:52,639
A Chinese cop wants me to kill him.

204
00:10:52,720 --> 00:10:54,240
Kill me! Just kill me!

205
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,559
Trying to play the hero saving the damsel?

206
00:11:01,399 --> 00:11:02,799
I kill her, you save her.

207
00:11:03,120 --> 00:11:04,159
Dying before her, huh?

208
00:11:04,399 --> 00:11:05,240
Come on, let me grant your wish.

209
00:11:06,159 --> 00:11:06,559
Come on!

210
00:11:06,600 --> 00:11:06,960
Come on!

211
00:11:07,039 --> 00:11:08,440
There never was a plan targeting you!

212
00:11:08,519 --> 00:11:09,960
But if you're a real man,

213
00:11:10,159 --> 00:11:11,799
let her go!

214
00:11:11,919 --> 00:11:13,879
Li Xiao, don't beg him!

215
00:11:15,639 --> 00:11:16,759
If you die,

216
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,960
how am I supposed to go on living?

217
00:11:20,279 --> 00:11:21,200
Meeting you

218
00:11:22,879 --> 00:11:23,919
is the one thing in my life

219
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,720
I will never regret.

220
00:11:28,039 --> 00:11:28,679
I'm sorry.

221
00:11:35,240 --> 00:11:35,759
To me,

222
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:39,440
you two have zero value right now.

223
00:11:39,639 --> 00:11:41,720
Brother Dong, dead people have even less value.

224
00:11:42,200 --> 00:11:42,919
Keeping the two of them alive

225
00:11:43,320 --> 00:11:44,600
might come in handy later.

226
00:11:45,519 --> 00:11:47,240
What good does keeping them do?

227
00:11:48,039 --> 00:11:49,320
Can they get Professor Du back,

228
00:11:50,039 --> 00:11:51,720
or bring my brother back?

229
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:54,039
We deal drugs just to make money.

230
00:11:54,360 --> 00:11:55,879
There's no need to slaughter the innocent.

231
00:11:55,919 --> 00:11:57,320
Slaughter the innocent?

232
00:11:58,519 --> 00:11:59,960
One dead cop,

233
00:12:00,120 --> 00:12:02,039
plus one dead cop's woman...

234
00:12:02,120 --> 00:12:03,200
Slaughter the innocent?

235
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:12,840
Something's not right.

236
00:12:20,039 --> 00:12:21,480
You're acting a bit strange.

237
00:12:22,399 --> 00:12:24,120
You aren't in league with them, are you?

238
00:12:24,360 --> 00:12:25,639
My brother's business isn't settled yet.

239
00:12:25,720 --> 00:12:27,240
Come on, we're all gonna die sooner or later.

240
00:12:27,440 --> 00:12:28,080
Move!

241
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:29,840
Brother Dong.

242
00:12:30,559 --> 00:12:31,960
Ah Kai is one of us.

243
00:12:32,399 --> 00:12:34,000
We can't let two outsiders

244
00:12:34,320 --> 00:12:35,840
turn us against our own brother.

245
00:12:37,000 --> 00:12:38,039
What if he's an undercover cop?

246
00:12:39,360 --> 00:12:40,120
No way.

247
00:12:40,159 --> 00:12:42,080
Ah Kai has been through hell and back with me.

248
00:12:42,279 --> 00:12:44,639
The cops almost killed him several times.

249
00:12:44,919 --> 00:12:46,000
He can't be an undercover cop.

250
00:12:46,159 --> 00:12:47,679
What if it was all an act?

251
00:12:48,279 --> 00:12:48,879
He wouldn't.

252
00:12:49,919 --> 00:12:50,519
Yes, Boss.

253
00:12:51,159 --> 00:12:53,080
It's the boss. Pick it up, quick.

254
00:13:00,919 --> 00:13:01,679
Boss.

255
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:02,840
What are you doing?

256
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:06,200
Rooting out the mole.

257
00:13:06,720 --> 00:13:09,120
Our guns aren't meant to point at our own men.

258
00:13:09,480 --> 00:13:11,840
Your crew fears you more than the cops.

259
00:13:11,919 --> 00:13:12,919
If this goes on,

260
00:13:13,360 --> 00:13:14,840
how will you lead your men?

261
00:13:15,279 --> 00:13:17,240
I just feel like he's not one of us.

262
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,440
Do you have proof he isn't?

263
00:13:19,759 --> 00:13:20,840
You can't just suspect anyone.

264
00:13:21,039 --> 00:13:21,919
For now,

265
00:13:22,679 --> 00:13:24,919
Wei Kai doesn't seem to be a cop.

266
00:13:26,159 --> 00:13:27,080
Fine.

267
00:13:28,159 --> 00:13:29,039
I'll let him live.

268
00:13:29,240 --> 00:13:29,759
And another thing.

269
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:32,000
That man and woman you took—

270
00:13:32,360 --> 00:13:33,759
don't touch them for now, either.

271
00:13:34,000 --> 00:13:34,799
Boss...

272
00:13:35,480 --> 00:13:36,879
We have them in our hands.

273
00:13:37,159 --> 00:13:38,519
We can kill them whenever we want.

274
00:13:39,399 --> 00:13:41,279
Keeping them alive might still be useful.

275
00:13:43,080 --> 00:13:44,759
The Country M police have been making moves.

276
00:13:45,759 --> 00:13:46,960
As for Ma Jingrong,

277
00:13:47,519 --> 00:13:49,240
don't make a move on him for now.

278
00:13:49,639 --> 00:13:51,679
Then who's going to pay for my brother's life?

279
00:13:51,879 --> 00:13:53,200
I will handle this matter personally.

280
00:13:53,279 --> 00:13:54,159
Don't worry.

281
00:13:54,600 --> 00:13:56,200
I'll make sure Xiang Nan gets justice.

282
00:13:58,200 --> 00:13:59,200
Alright.

283
00:14:11,039 --> 00:14:12,799
I'm finding you more and more interesting.

284
00:14:13,519 --> 00:14:15,200
Even the boss pleaded for you.

285
00:14:16,559 --> 00:14:17,559
Take the two of them away.

286
00:14:18,039 --> 00:14:19,440
Look after them well for the boss.

287
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:29,279
What a good dog for the boss.

288
00:14:29,480 --> 00:14:30,279
I'm sorry, Brother Dong.

289
00:14:30,440 --> 00:14:31,559
The boss personally ordered us

290
00:14:31,720 --> 00:14:33,879
to report all major matters to him first.

291
00:14:34,279 --> 00:14:34,960
What's important?

292
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:36,879
You tell me what qualifies as important.

293
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:38,240
Is killing a few people important?

294
00:14:38,679 --> 00:14:39,799
And a cop at that.

295
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:46,480
Thanks.

296
00:14:46,559 --> 00:14:47,240
Don't thank me.

297
00:14:48,080 --> 00:14:49,360
It's not that I wanted to help you.

298
00:14:49,919 --> 00:14:52,679
I just didn't want to get dragged down by Brother Dong.

299
00:15:02,279 --> 00:15:03,000
What's on your mind?

300
00:15:04,159 --> 00:15:04,840
Let's go.

301
00:15:05,519 --> 00:15:07,200
How can Brother Dong have a boss above him?

302
00:15:07,360 --> 00:15:08,960
You just cheated death.

303
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:10,120
Why overthink it?

304
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:11,399
Come on, let's grab a drink.

305
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,279
Really, thanks to you today, Brother Si.

306
00:15:13,720 --> 00:15:14,399
If it weren't for you,

307
00:15:14,720 --> 00:15:15,879
I'd have lost my life back there.

308
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:16,559
Brother.

309
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:20,440
When Brother Dong pointed a gun at my head,

310
00:15:20,759 --> 00:15:22,240
didn't you speak up for me, too?

311
00:15:22,600 --> 00:15:23,519
A brother like you,

312
00:15:26,080 --> 00:15:27,000
I'm keeping for life.

313
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,840
Do these two people

314
00:15:34,120 --> 00:15:35,559
have any special meaning to you?

315
00:15:37,320 --> 00:15:38,200
None whatsoever.

316
00:15:46,360 --> 00:15:47,840
I told you guys not to wait for me.

317
00:15:47,879 --> 00:15:49,159
Look, the food's already cold.

318
00:15:49,240 --> 00:15:50,080
Hurry up and eat.

319
00:15:51,639 --> 00:15:53,840
It's been so long since I had your cooking, Auntie.

320
00:15:53,840 --> 00:15:54,799
It still tastes just like before.

321
00:15:55,000 --> 00:15:56,519
- Back then, you and Xiaoxiao...
- Thank you, Auntie.

322
00:15:56,519 --> 00:15:58,320
could often come over for dinner.

323
00:15:58,480 --> 00:15:59,360
When the house was lively,

324
00:15:59,519 --> 00:16:00,440
an old woman like me

325
00:16:00,679 --> 00:16:02,200
didn't feel so lonely.

326
00:16:02,559 --> 00:16:05,320
But ever since you two started at the bureau,

327
00:16:05,600 --> 00:16:06,840
you've rarely come over.

328
00:16:07,159 --> 00:16:07,799
With no one around,

329
00:16:08,080 --> 00:16:09,080
it's felt so quiet and empty.

330
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,039
By the way,

331
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:13,039
why hasn't Xiao been coming over to eat lately?

332
00:16:13,559 --> 00:16:15,039
What's he so busy with all day?

333
00:16:17,840 --> 00:16:18,639
I'm asking you.

334
00:16:20,600 --> 00:16:21,919
What is Xiao busy with?

335
00:16:23,639 --> 00:16:24,799
Didn't I already tell you?

336
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,000
He went on a business trip out of town.

337
00:16:26,440 --> 00:16:28,799
A business trip? Why is it taking so long?

338
00:16:30,440 --> 00:16:32,360
Last time, I told him to bring his girlfriend for dinner,

339
00:16:32,480 --> 00:16:33,480
and he never did.

340
00:16:33,960 --> 00:16:34,840
When he gets back,

341
00:16:35,200 --> 00:16:36,559
you make sure he remembers.

342
00:16:36,679 --> 00:16:37,480
Got it.

343
00:16:38,879 --> 00:16:39,279
Jing,

344
00:16:39,480 --> 00:16:40,120
have some more food.

345
00:16:41,159 --> 00:16:41,519
Okay.

346
00:16:41,960 --> 00:16:43,360
Don't listen to your auntie's nagging.

347
00:16:43,759 --> 00:16:44,080
Here.

348
00:16:44,399 --> 00:16:46,120
You rarely visit. Eat more.

349
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:52,480
Jiang Liye sent Duna to Jiechan State to pick up the goods.

350
00:16:52,679 --> 00:16:54,279
And he said that in three days,

351
00:16:54,279 --> 00:16:56,720
he wants me to go with him to Jiangyang for the deal.

352
00:16:56,919 --> 00:16:58,559
Jiang Liye also told me

353
00:16:58,559 --> 00:16:59,240
to give the border officials a heads-up,

354
00:16:59,519 --> 00:17:01,440
saying we'd use a trading company's name

355
00:17:01,799 --> 00:17:03,519
to send Country M local specialties to Jiangyang.

356
00:17:03,960 --> 00:17:05,119
That's what he told me, too.

357
00:17:06,039 --> 00:17:07,119
And the buyer this time

358
00:17:07,119 --> 00:17:09,279
is a woman named Li Kexin.

359
00:17:09,680 --> 00:17:10,599
I heard from Wenqing

360
00:17:10,799 --> 00:17:11,640
that this Li Kexin

361
00:17:11,640 --> 00:17:13,519
supposedly deals in Country M local specialties,

362
00:17:13,839 --> 00:17:15,880
but is secretly running drugs.

363
00:17:16,160 --> 00:17:18,160
If Jiang Liye delivers the goods in person,

364
00:17:18,880 --> 00:17:21,200
Chinese police can catch him red-handed with the goods

365
00:17:21,200 --> 00:17:22,200
and bring him to justice.

366
00:17:22,200 --> 00:17:22,559
Wait...

367
00:17:23,119 --> 00:17:24,680
Jiang Liye wants me to go with him.

368
00:17:25,119 --> 00:17:26,920
That means he won't be the only one arrested.

369
00:17:28,359 --> 00:17:29,319
I'll be arrested, too.

370
00:17:29,599 --> 00:17:31,519
Do the Chinese police know about me?

371
00:17:31,720 --> 00:17:32,640
That's the same as throwing him and me

372
00:17:32,640 --> 00:17:34,000
into prison together!

373
00:17:34,160 --> 00:17:36,160
I don't ever want to go back to that hellhole!

374
00:17:36,240 --> 00:17:37,440
Don't worry about that.

375
00:17:38,319 --> 00:17:39,960
I've already notified the Chinese police

376
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:40,799
multiple times.

377
00:17:41,359 --> 00:17:42,160
"Don't worry, don't worry."

378
00:17:42,640 --> 00:17:43,559
Why don't you say it a few more times?

379
00:17:43,559 --> 00:17:45,400
I don't think it's that simple.

380
00:17:45,599 --> 00:17:47,440
Even if Jiang Liye is shipping goods soon,

381
00:17:47,799 --> 00:17:50,079
he wouldn't reveal the shipping time,

382
00:17:50,279 --> 00:17:51,880
location, and recipient details this early.

383
00:17:52,960 --> 00:17:55,079
Besides, Li Qiang just arrived in Country M

384
00:17:55,079 --> 00:17:56,119
and was immediately targeted by the police.

385
00:17:56,279 --> 00:17:57,519
So Theerade and Jiang Liye

386
00:17:57,519 --> 00:17:59,200
must be suspicious of our identities.

387
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:00,359
But right now,

388
00:18:00,680 --> 00:18:02,440
sending Tony with Jiang Liye for the pickup

389
00:18:02,720 --> 00:18:04,240
doesn't fit the way they operate.

390
00:18:05,400 --> 00:18:06,640
Are you sure

391
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:09,079
that Jiang Liye stopped monitoring you?

392
00:18:09,440 --> 00:18:11,000
They really haven't been watching us lately.

393
00:18:11,519 --> 00:18:14,079
But I have Gedan watching from the opposite building.

394
00:18:24,559 --> 00:18:26,680
Our previous buyers could only take, at most,

395
00:18:26,680 --> 00:18:27,799
a third of our goods.

396
00:18:28,519 --> 00:18:29,599
Since Zhuang Cen and his people

397
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,920
have already connected us with

398
00:18:30,920 --> 00:18:32,279
a major client like Shen Xinru,

399
00:18:32,880 --> 00:18:34,119
why don't we seize this chance

400
00:18:34,119 --> 00:18:35,640
to break into the Chinese market?

401
00:18:37,559 --> 00:18:38,680
You're right.

402
00:18:39,759 --> 00:18:40,920
But regarding this matter,

403
00:18:41,519 --> 00:18:43,839
Mr. Theerade still has some concerns.

404
00:18:46,200 --> 00:18:49,200
I asked people who frequently move goods to China.

405
00:18:49,799 --> 00:18:52,000
There really is a Shen Xinru in Zhuwan.

406
00:18:52,039 --> 00:18:53,359
Could it be that Mr. Theerade

407
00:18:53,839 --> 00:18:55,440
thinks something is wrong with her?

408
00:18:55,720 --> 00:18:57,319
What Mr. Theerade is worried about

409
00:18:57,319 --> 00:19:00,000
is the person acting as the middleman.

410
00:19:01,599 --> 00:19:03,000
The middleman?

411
00:19:04,480 --> 00:19:08,039
Someone might want to take us

412
00:19:08,720 --> 00:19:09,960
and Shen Xinru out all at once.

413
00:19:10,720 --> 00:19:13,400
Does he mean Ma Jingrong and Zhuang Cen?

414
00:19:13,400 --> 00:19:16,000
Theerade is extremely cautious.

415
00:19:16,279 --> 00:19:17,559
He'd rather kill a thousand by mistake

416
00:19:17,799 --> 00:19:18,880
than let a single one slip through.

417
00:19:19,519 --> 00:19:21,720
Right now, the three of you plus Ma Jingrong

418
00:19:21,799 --> 00:19:24,319
could all become targets of their suspicion.

419
00:19:24,680 --> 00:19:26,680
Theerade pulled the men tailing us this time

420
00:19:27,160 --> 00:19:28,559
first, to lower our guard,

421
00:19:28,720 --> 00:19:30,720
and second, to have Tony bring us the news.

422
00:19:33,359 --> 00:19:35,799
So if the police target Jiang Liye

423
00:19:35,799 --> 00:19:36,559
or Li Kexin

424
00:19:36,640 --> 00:19:37,960
with any kind of action,

425
00:19:38,359 --> 00:19:40,000
your identities will be exposed, right?

426
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:44,559
Would he walk into a trap just to confirm a suspicion?

427
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:47,000
Is Jiang Liye really that foolish?

428
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,279
But Ma Jingrong

429
00:19:48,319 --> 00:19:50,279
used to work for Piyazi.

430
00:19:51,279 --> 00:19:54,200
Besides, both of them have served time in high-security prison.

431
00:19:55,480 --> 00:19:57,240
The prison is precisely where the problem lies.

432
00:19:57,400 --> 00:19:59,319
Maybe the two of them

433
00:19:59,599 --> 00:20:01,039
were bought off by the police while in prison.

434
00:20:01,599 --> 00:20:03,839
Or maybe Ma Jingrong was an undercover cop

435
00:20:03,839 --> 00:20:06,240
planted at Piyazi's side all along.

436
00:20:06,920 --> 00:20:09,680
Otherwise, why did Ma Jingrong's so-called brother,

437
00:20:09,759 --> 00:20:10,920
the moment he arrived in Country M,

438
00:20:11,039 --> 00:20:12,440
get targeted by the police?

439
00:20:12,799 --> 00:20:14,000
The real reason behind all this

440
00:20:14,839 --> 00:20:16,200
is something none of us knows yet.

441
00:20:16,519 --> 00:20:18,400
Li Qiang was wanted in China,

442
00:20:18,519 --> 00:20:19,680
which is why he fled to Country M.

443
00:20:20,039 --> 00:20:21,559
And previously, one of his brothers

444
00:20:21,559 --> 00:20:23,119
was gunned down by the police in Jiangyang.

445
00:20:24,720 --> 00:20:26,559
If Ma Jingrong works for the police,

446
00:20:26,799 --> 00:20:28,559
then Li Qiang coming to Country M

447
00:20:28,599 --> 00:20:30,440
is likely for revenge.

448
00:20:31,240 --> 00:20:33,759
The police are hunting Li Qiang everywhere

449
00:20:34,920 --> 00:20:38,279
because his appearance

450
00:20:38,599 --> 00:20:40,119
would blow Ma Jingrong's cover.

451
00:20:40,119 --> 00:20:42,759
These are just Mr. Theerade's and my speculations.

452
00:20:43,319 --> 00:20:45,400
Maybe we're overthinking it.

453
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:48,079
Still, when it comes to those two,

454
00:20:48,079 --> 00:20:49,880
we still need to stay on high alert.

455
00:20:53,599 --> 00:20:54,920
Since Mr. Theerade

456
00:20:54,960 --> 00:20:56,119
is already suspicious of them,

457
00:20:56,880 --> 00:21:01,000
why did he have Tony work under you?

458
00:21:02,759 --> 00:21:05,039
Someone has to feed them information.

459
00:21:07,240 --> 00:21:10,160
Jiang Liye sending Duna to Jiechan State for the pickup

460
00:21:10,480 --> 00:21:11,920
isn't just to put on a show.

461
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,559
If I'm not mistaken,

462
00:21:13,559 --> 00:21:15,799
Theerade isn't just testing us this time.

463
00:21:15,960 --> 00:21:18,000
He might be pulling a bait and switch.

464
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,039
I get it.

465
00:21:19,519 --> 00:21:21,720
Meaning Jiang Liye deliberately leaked

466
00:21:21,720 --> 00:21:22,960
fake intel to Tony.

467
00:21:22,960 --> 00:21:24,359
While keeping tabs on you,

468
00:21:24,559 --> 00:21:26,599
he can also find a way to move the goods.

469
00:21:26,759 --> 00:21:28,920
Exactly. And the delivery time and location

470
00:21:29,720 --> 00:21:31,440
are definitely not what Tony heard.

471
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:34,200
Besides, the person delivering the local specialty to Li Kexin

472
00:21:34,319 --> 00:21:35,720
won't be Jiang Liye himself.

473
00:21:36,720 --> 00:21:37,440
But...

474
00:21:37,599 --> 00:21:39,960
Jiang Liye said I'm going with him to make the drop.

475
00:21:40,119 --> 00:21:40,960
Before heading out,

476
00:21:40,960 --> 00:21:42,559
he'll just make up an excuse to brush you off.

477
00:21:43,200 --> 00:21:44,079
Right now,

478
00:21:44,279 --> 00:21:45,640
what we need to confirm is

479
00:21:45,759 --> 00:21:47,519
whether Jiang Liye is heading to Jiangyang,

480
00:21:47,759 --> 00:21:49,759
and whether he arranged another deal.

481
00:21:50,240 --> 00:21:51,480
Jiang Liye has two confidants.

482
00:21:52,079 --> 00:21:53,440
One is Duna, and the other is Wenqing.

483
00:21:53,759 --> 00:21:54,839
Duna handles external affairs,

484
00:21:55,079 --> 00:21:56,200
using muscle to get things done.

485
00:21:56,559 --> 00:21:58,960
Wenqing is Jiang Liye's most trusted man.

486
00:21:59,519 --> 00:22:01,720
Wenqing knows everything about Jiang Liye, big and small.

487
00:22:01,839 --> 00:22:03,480
So our lead for this investigation

488
00:22:03,759 --> 00:22:04,599
has to be Wenqing.

489
00:22:05,119 --> 00:22:05,920
I know about him.

490
00:22:06,279 --> 00:22:07,039
Wenqing...

491
00:22:07,079 --> 00:22:07,599
Wen—

492
00:22:09,119 --> 00:22:10,000
Sorry.

493
00:22:10,640 --> 00:22:12,640
From what I've observed of Wenqing,

494
00:22:12,880 --> 00:22:14,799
he always keeps track on his phone of

495
00:22:14,799 --> 00:22:16,759
every assignment Jiang Liye gives him.

496
00:22:17,640 --> 00:22:20,519
If we just get our hands on his phone,

497
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:22,799
won't we know the full schedule

498
00:22:22,799 --> 00:22:24,079
for Jiang Liye's delivery?

499
00:22:26,640 --> 00:22:27,440
You're right.

500
00:22:29,680 --> 00:22:30,519
Me again?

501
00:22:30,599 --> 00:22:31,000
All right.

502
00:22:31,240 --> 00:22:32,240
That settles it.

503
00:22:32,559 --> 00:22:33,839
You won't be doing this alone.

504
00:22:34,079 --> 00:22:36,640
All you have to do is make Wenqing let his guard down.

505
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,440
Time is running out.

506
00:22:37,720 --> 00:22:38,759
We need to clear out too.

507
00:22:38,920 --> 00:22:40,640
Call and check what the weather is like over there.

508
00:22:50,720 --> 00:22:51,200
Honey,

509
00:22:51,759 --> 00:22:52,640
How's the weather?

510
00:22:52,839 --> 00:22:53,559
The weather's great.

511
00:22:53,880 --> 00:22:54,720
Hurry back home.

512
00:22:55,359 --> 00:22:57,559
Don't forget that matter with the Chinese police.

513
00:22:58,119 --> 00:22:58,839
Clear skies.

514
00:22:59,160 --> 00:23:00,160
We can pull out now.

515
00:23:00,960 --> 00:23:02,279
Send a few more photos of me.

516
00:23:02,720 --> 00:23:03,960
Make sure they remember who I am.

517
00:23:04,359 --> 00:23:05,480
Alright, let's go.

518
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,079
Siqi,

519
00:23:13,200 --> 00:23:14,519
There's something I want to tell you.

520
00:23:15,079 --> 00:23:16,519
I wonder if you're free right now.

521
00:23:17,359 --> 00:23:18,640
Sure, I am.

522
00:23:18,920 --> 00:23:21,000
I'm at Geya Cafe on Roman Street.

523
00:23:21,240 --> 00:23:22,359
Can you come over?

524
00:23:22,759 --> 00:23:24,240
Alright, see you in a bit.

525
00:23:34,799 --> 00:23:35,799
Siqi asked to meet me now

526
00:23:35,799 --> 00:23:37,079
at Geya Coffee on Roman Street.

527
00:23:37,279 --> 00:23:38,279
I don't know what it's about.

528
00:23:38,279 --> 00:23:39,279
All right, you go ahead.

529
00:23:39,480 --> 00:23:40,480
I'll join you in a bit.

530
00:23:40,680 --> 00:23:41,640
Okay, see you in a bit.

531
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:03,000
Siqi.

532
00:24:03,920 --> 00:24:04,680
Xiaobai, you're here.

533
00:24:05,119 --> 00:24:05,599
Have a seat.

534
00:24:07,880 --> 00:24:09,359
My cab driver didn't know the way,

535
00:24:09,359 --> 00:24:10,079
so I'm late.

536
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,880
What can I get you to drink, miss?

537
00:24:11,960 --> 00:24:12,920
Coffee, please. Thank you.

538
00:24:13,039 --> 00:24:13,480
Right away.

539
00:24:14,039 --> 00:24:15,880
Where's Zhuang Cen? Didn't he come with you?

540
00:24:16,599 --> 00:24:18,599
Why bring him along for girl talk?

541
00:24:19,279 --> 00:24:19,799
True.

542
00:24:20,799 --> 00:24:22,799
Men always have their own business to handle.

543
00:24:26,079 --> 00:24:27,079
The reason I asked you out today...

544
00:24:27,480 --> 00:24:28,400
It's nothing serious, really.

545
00:24:29,119 --> 00:24:30,759
I just wanted someone to talk to.

546
00:24:30,960 --> 00:24:31,400
Sure.

547
00:24:34,880 --> 00:24:36,039
There's something...

548
00:24:38,240 --> 00:24:39,880
I don't know how to tell Brother Rong.

549
00:24:43,759 --> 00:24:44,920
I'm pregnant.

550
00:24:45,240 --> 00:24:46,000
Really?

551
00:24:51,200 --> 00:24:52,279
Brother Rong and I...

552
00:24:52,759 --> 00:24:54,119
We've been together for so many years,

553
00:24:55,119 --> 00:24:57,279
and we've been through so much together.

554
00:24:57,839 --> 00:24:59,519
I know he has his ambitions,

555
00:25:00,319 --> 00:25:02,960
but now, all I want is a peaceful life.

556
00:25:04,200 --> 00:25:05,799
I used to keep things to myself

557
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:08,079
so he wouldn't get distracted.

558
00:25:08,680 --> 00:25:09,440
But honestly...

559
00:25:09,599 --> 00:25:11,160
what woman wants her man

560
00:25:11,160 --> 00:25:12,440
risking his life for money,

561
00:25:12,960 --> 00:25:14,359
living with no guarantee of tomorrow?

562
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,960
When it was just the two of us,

563
00:25:17,400 --> 00:25:18,680
no matter how much we drifted around

564
00:25:18,720 --> 00:25:20,079
or suffered, it didn't matter.

565
00:25:20,960 --> 00:25:21,880
But now...

566
00:25:22,680 --> 00:25:24,519
I just want to give him a real home.

567
00:25:26,400 --> 00:25:28,319
Yet I don't know how to bring it up.

568
00:25:28,519 --> 00:25:30,960
I'm afraid he won't handle it well, just like last time.

569
00:25:31,839 --> 00:25:32,680
Are you saying...

570
00:25:34,079 --> 00:25:35,319
the last time you two...?

571
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:39,960
Siqi...

572
00:25:40,119 --> 00:25:41,519
I think something like this,

573
00:25:41,799 --> 00:25:43,400
for any woman,

574
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:44,480
should be a wonderful blessing.

575
00:25:44,680 --> 00:25:46,680
Why do you have to carry all this pain alone?

576
00:25:47,000 --> 00:25:48,720
I actually understand Brother Rong.

577
00:25:50,759 --> 00:25:52,519
He looks tough on the outside,

578
00:25:52,519 --> 00:25:54,799
but deep down, he's deeply insecure.

579
00:25:55,240 --> 00:25:56,920
Unless he gets out of this life right now,

580
00:25:57,519 --> 00:25:59,599
he won't want this baby to be born.

581
00:26:26,680 --> 00:26:27,400
Zhuang Yan!

582
00:26:32,480 --> 00:26:33,200
Zhuang Yan!

583
00:26:33,960 --> 00:26:35,279
Let go of me!

584
00:26:35,519 --> 00:26:36,480
Zhuang Yan?

585
00:26:39,200 --> 00:26:40,039
Is that you?

586
00:26:40,799 --> 00:26:41,640
Xiaoyi?

587
00:26:44,640 --> 00:26:45,799
It really is you!

588
00:26:46,359 --> 00:26:47,119
I called you so many times just now,

589
00:26:47,119 --> 00:26:48,079
but you didn't react.

590
00:26:48,359 --> 00:26:49,759
I thought I had the wrong person.

591
00:26:49,880 --> 00:26:50,839
No, I changed my name.

592
00:26:51,160 --> 00:26:52,039
I don't go by Zhuang Yan anymore.

593
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:53,119
Besides, I never expected

594
00:26:53,119 --> 00:26:54,079
to run into you abroad.

595
00:26:56,119 --> 00:26:57,279
So what's your name now?

596
00:26:57,680 --> 00:26:58,279
Zhuang Cen.

597
00:26:58,559 --> 00:27:00,119
The mountain radical over "jin."

598
00:27:01,039 --> 00:27:02,240
Zhuang Cen.

599
00:27:05,079 --> 00:27:06,079
I still think Zhuang Yan sounds better.

600
00:27:06,960 --> 00:27:07,920
It's been so many years.

601
00:27:09,279 --> 00:27:10,680
Never thought I'd run into you here.

602
00:27:12,599 --> 00:27:13,640
Meeting an old friend far from home...

603
00:27:14,240 --> 00:27:15,279
It must be fate.

604
00:27:19,079 --> 00:27:19,759
Then why don't you

605
00:27:22,119 --> 00:27:23,559
talk him into getting out now?

606
00:27:24,480 --> 00:27:26,400
His business here is just getting started.

607
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:28,039
If I tell him to quit now,

608
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:29,440
he definitely won't listen.

609
00:27:31,079 --> 00:27:32,319
Here's your coffee.

610
00:27:32,319 --> 00:27:32,960
Thank you.

611
00:27:39,039 --> 00:27:40,680
I think when two people are together,

612
00:27:41,200 --> 00:27:43,079
they should face everything together.

613
00:27:43,279 --> 00:27:45,119
You shouldn't bear it all on your own,

614
00:27:45,680 --> 00:27:46,400
right?

615
00:27:47,839 --> 00:27:48,759
Do you also think

616
00:27:50,359 --> 00:27:52,480
I should keep the baby?

617
00:27:52,920 --> 00:27:54,000
No matter what,

618
00:27:54,480 --> 00:27:55,920
the baby is innocent.

619
00:27:56,279 --> 00:27:58,519
No one has the right to take a life.

620
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:01,039
In matters like this,

621
00:28:01,599 --> 00:28:04,640
we shouldn't always let men make the call.

622
00:28:04,920 --> 00:28:07,359
We should choose the life we want, too.

623
00:28:07,519 --> 00:28:09,359
But I think Brother Rong has a point.

624
00:28:09,559 --> 00:28:11,640
Look at our current living conditions.

625
00:28:12,839 --> 00:28:14,559
It's no place to raise a child.

626
00:28:15,400 --> 00:28:16,599
I've actually thought about

627
00:28:16,759 --> 00:28:19,519
quietly getting an abortion on my own.

628
00:28:20,440 --> 00:28:21,839
Yet I can't bring myself to do it.

629
00:28:23,079 --> 00:28:24,599
What do you think I should do?

630
00:28:24,960 --> 00:28:26,400
Have you ever thought about it?

631
00:28:26,480 --> 00:28:28,039
When we grow old one day,

632
00:28:28,400 --> 00:28:30,440
with no family by our side,

633
00:28:31,240 --> 00:28:32,519
how lonely that will be.

634
00:28:34,279 --> 00:28:35,319
I have Brother Rong.

635
00:28:37,839 --> 00:28:39,720
I don't know if I should say this,

636
00:28:40,680 --> 00:28:41,759
but you know as well as I do:

637
00:28:43,160 --> 00:28:44,119
on this path,

638
00:28:45,200 --> 00:28:48,160
there's no guarantee of tomorrow.

639
00:28:54,920 --> 00:28:55,480
Wenqing,

640
00:28:56,279 --> 00:28:57,799
acting on your own like this...

641
00:28:58,880 --> 00:29:00,440
aren't you afraid the boss will come down on you?

642
00:29:02,160 --> 00:29:03,319
The boss has had his eye on that woman

643
00:29:03,319 --> 00:29:04,599
for quite some time now.

644
00:29:05,000 --> 00:29:06,440
It's just that her husband

645
00:29:06,559 --> 00:29:07,759
is currently doing business with us,

646
00:29:08,039 --> 00:29:09,200
so he couldn't make a move.

647
00:29:11,359 --> 00:29:14,160
I hired some unfamiliar faces to kidnap her.

648
00:29:14,400 --> 00:29:15,480
Who'd ever know it was me?

649
00:29:15,720 --> 00:29:16,880
Once it's done,

650
00:29:18,079 --> 00:29:19,599
do you think the boss will chew me out,

651
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:20,960
or praise me?

652
00:29:24,640 --> 00:29:26,200
You really are a sharp one.

653
00:29:26,720 --> 00:29:28,359
Lina, put some muscle into it.

654
00:29:28,720 --> 00:29:30,799
That kid's wicked as hell.

655
00:29:35,599 --> 00:29:37,079
Haven't heard a word from you in years.

656
00:29:37,400 --> 00:29:38,400
Didn't even know where you went.

657
00:29:38,440 --> 00:29:39,440
You never showed up to class reunions.

658
00:29:41,200 --> 00:29:42,079
How have you been?

659
00:29:43,119 --> 00:29:43,920
Not bad.

660
00:29:43,920 --> 00:29:45,759
I was abroad for the past few years,

661
00:29:45,920 --> 00:29:47,480
got a master's degree in economics.

662
00:29:48,359 --> 00:29:50,799
Now I work at a foreign firm back home.

663
00:29:51,200 --> 00:29:52,519
Life's been treating me pretty well.

664
00:29:53,039 --> 00:29:53,559
How about you?

665
00:29:54,559 --> 00:29:55,240
Me?

666
00:29:56,559 --> 00:29:58,319
I was always the biggest troublemaker in class.

667
00:29:58,720 --> 00:30:00,200
Never really amounted to anything.

668
00:30:00,759 --> 00:30:01,839
Come on.

669
00:30:03,440 --> 00:30:05,279
Back then, our teachers always said

670
00:30:06,240 --> 00:30:08,039
you might be the biggest troublemaker in class,

671
00:30:08,440 --> 00:30:09,519
but you were also the smartest.

672
00:30:10,440 --> 00:30:12,480
Who'd believe you didn't amount to anything?

673
00:30:13,960 --> 00:30:15,279
If I were really that smart,

674
00:30:15,799 --> 00:30:17,599
I wouldn't have let you take top of our grade every time.

675
00:30:19,759 --> 00:30:20,799
As for me,

676
00:30:21,440 --> 00:30:22,240
my IQ is decent,

677
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:23,319
but my EQ...

678
00:30:24,319 --> 00:30:25,160
totally hopeless.

679
00:30:25,160 --> 00:30:26,240
Can't keep my life together,

680
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:27,480
got no career plans.

681
00:30:27,759 --> 00:30:28,519
All these years,

682
00:30:28,599 --> 00:30:29,799
I don't even know how I scraped by.

683
00:30:30,200 --> 00:30:30,759
Look at me now—

684
00:30:30,920 --> 00:30:32,279
couldn't cut it back home, so here I am abroad.

685
00:30:33,160 --> 00:30:34,839
Stop teasing me.

686
00:30:35,519 --> 00:30:37,119
Someone as gifted as you,

687
00:30:37,200 --> 00:30:38,880
even if you deliberately tried to mess up your life,

688
00:30:39,440 --> 00:30:40,920
you'd still do better than ordinary folks.

689
00:30:42,599 --> 00:30:44,319
Have you heard of Hesheng Group in Country M?

690
00:30:45,720 --> 00:30:46,680
Hesheng Group?

691
00:30:49,000 --> 00:30:52,160
You mean you work at Hesheng Group?

692
00:30:52,839 --> 00:30:53,640
Sort of.

693
00:30:53,880 --> 00:30:55,079
Just coasting along with the boss.

694
00:30:55,640 --> 00:30:56,400
You know...

695
00:30:58,839 --> 00:30:59,359
Xiaoyi.

696
00:31:00,440 --> 00:31:01,000
Well, well.

697
00:31:01,559 --> 00:31:03,599
Made a new friend as soon as you arrived in Country M?

698
00:31:05,559 --> 00:31:06,559
Not a new friend.

699
00:31:06,960 --> 00:31:08,440
An old friend from way back.

700
00:31:09,599 --> 00:31:11,480
An elementary school classmate of mine, Zhuang Yan.

701
00:31:11,480 --> 00:31:12,319
It's Zhuang Cen now.

702
00:31:12,319 --> 00:31:12,799
Right.

703
00:31:13,119 --> 00:31:13,799
Zhuang Cen.

704
00:31:15,079 --> 00:31:16,039
This is my boss,

705
00:31:16,279 --> 00:31:18,039
Long Zhiyuan, Chairman of Longze Group.

706
00:31:19,359 --> 00:31:20,480
Hello. It's a pleasure to meet you.

707
00:31:20,480 --> 00:31:20,960
Pleasure to meet you.

708
00:31:28,680 --> 00:31:30,559
I've felt so suffocated all day.

709
00:31:31,039 --> 00:31:32,720
Hearing what you said made me feel much better.

710
00:31:33,160 --> 00:31:33,880
Thank you.

711
00:31:35,960 --> 00:31:37,319
So have you decided

712
00:31:37,799 --> 00:31:38,920
what you're going to do?

713
00:31:39,880 --> 00:31:40,599
I have.

714
00:31:41,119 --> 00:31:43,200
Reality isn't as terrifying as I thought.

715
00:31:43,680 --> 00:31:45,519
I just wasn't brave enough before.

716
00:31:46,480 --> 00:31:47,960
Now, I really hope he comes out.

717
00:31:48,279 --> 00:31:49,200
I want to show him

718
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:50,480
how beautiful this world is.

719
00:31:54,000 --> 00:31:54,599
Watch out!

720
00:32:06,279 --> 00:32:07,039
Let go of me!

721
00:32:07,759 --> 00:32:08,240
Let go!

722
00:32:09,519 --> 00:32:10,440
Who are you people?

723
00:32:11,559 --> 00:32:12,119
Xiaobai!

724
00:32:20,640 --> 00:32:21,039
Run!

725
00:32:26,480 --> 00:32:27,079
Xiaobai!

726
00:32:35,240 --> 00:32:35,880
Are you okay?

727
00:32:57,960 --> 00:32:58,920
You're pretty good in a fight.

728
00:32:59,559 --> 00:33:00,160
You're not bad yourself.

729
00:33:01,279 --> 00:33:01,839
You all right?

730
00:33:15,279 --> 00:33:15,720
What?

731
00:33:18,200 --> 00:33:19,599
You can't even handle a simple thing like this?

732
00:33:19,960 --> 00:33:20,839
Find a place to lay low.

733
00:33:21,480 --> 00:33:21,880
Wait for my word.

734
00:33:23,640 --> 00:33:24,720
What's wrong? What happened?

735
00:33:25,279 --> 00:33:26,279
Zhuang Cen got involved.

736
00:33:27,240 --> 00:33:28,200
Idiots!

737
00:33:28,400 --> 00:33:29,799
They even botched a kidnapping.

738
00:33:33,599 --> 00:33:35,559
That punk is no pushover.

739
00:33:36,640 --> 00:33:38,200
We can't make any more moves.

740
00:33:38,599 --> 00:33:40,680
We can't afford to ruin Sir's big plans.

741
00:33:45,759 --> 00:33:46,559
Mr. Long,

742
00:33:47,000 --> 00:33:48,119
you're not just a business elite,

743
00:33:48,240 --> 00:33:49,200
but you're also an incredible fighter.

744
00:33:49,519 --> 00:33:51,680
Were you a cop before?

745
00:33:53,160 --> 00:33:55,319
Our chairman is a professional Sanda fighter.

746
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:58,160
He even won gold in international competitions.

747
00:33:58,200 --> 00:33:58,680
No wonder.

748
00:33:59,200 --> 00:34:00,480
If Mr. Long hadn't stepped in today,

749
00:34:00,599 --> 00:34:02,000
we'd all be lying in the morgue.

750
00:34:02,279 --> 00:34:03,640
Someone with skills like yours,

751
00:34:03,759 --> 00:34:05,400
why would you work at Hesheng Group

752
00:34:05,400 --> 00:34:06,480
as a regular employee?

753
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,400
Because I'm a cop.

754
00:34:10,960 --> 00:34:12,719
Others might not believe that,

755
00:34:13,320 --> 00:34:14,519
but I actually would.

756
00:34:15,960 --> 00:34:18,840
Then is the woman inside your partner?

757
00:34:20,199 --> 00:34:21,320
There are many kinds of partners.

758
00:34:21,559 --> 00:34:23,079
Which kind do you mean, Mr. Long?

759
00:34:23,840 --> 00:34:26,239
She and I are life partners.

760
00:34:32,559 --> 00:34:33,559
How is she? What did the doctor say?

761
00:34:33,960 --> 00:34:35,639
A concussion and severe shock

762
00:34:35,639 --> 00:34:36,599
caused the coma.

763
00:34:36,960 --> 00:34:38,440
But there's no intracranial hemorrhage.

764
00:34:38,599 --> 00:34:39,480
It's a miracle.

765
00:34:39,519 --> 00:34:40,280
Thank you.

766
00:34:40,599 --> 00:34:41,960
If you hadn't been there today,

767
00:34:42,400 --> 00:34:43,880
I'm afraid those thugs would have...

768
00:34:43,880 --> 00:34:44,679
Don't mention it.

769
00:34:44,920 --> 00:34:46,199
We're all Chinese.

770
00:34:46,599 --> 00:34:47,320
When we're abroad,

771
00:34:47,360 --> 00:34:48,559
we should look out for each other.

772
00:34:48,639 --> 00:34:49,119
Brother Ma.

773
00:34:49,360 --> 00:34:50,320
What happened, Siqi?

774
00:34:51,320 --> 00:34:52,679
Xiao Zhuang just called me.

775
00:34:53,119 --> 00:34:54,079
What on earth happened?

776
00:34:54,679 --> 00:34:55,760
The doctor said it's nothing serious.

777
00:34:56,280 --> 00:34:57,679
Just go home and get some good rest.

778
00:34:58,320 --> 00:34:59,320
What happened, Xiao Zhuang?

779
00:34:59,440 --> 00:35:00,800
Xiaobai went for coffee with Sister-in-law,

780
00:35:00,960 --> 00:35:03,639
and right outside the cafe, thugs kidnapped her.

781
00:35:05,400 --> 00:35:06,519
They're the ones who saved me.

782
00:35:07,599 --> 00:35:08,719
Along with this gentleman.

783
00:35:10,280 --> 00:35:12,400
Thank you. May I ask your name, sir?

784
00:35:13,000 --> 00:35:14,840
My name is Long. Long Zhiyuan.

785
00:35:18,000 --> 00:35:19,199
Thank you, Mr. Long.

786
00:35:19,480 --> 00:35:21,679
Why? Have you heard my name before?

787
00:35:22,039 --> 00:35:23,840
It sounds familiar. A good name.

788
00:35:24,000 --> 00:35:25,199
I came to Country M this time

789
00:35:25,320 --> 00:35:26,719
to look for business partners.

790
00:35:27,239 --> 00:35:29,360
I might need everyone's help down the line.

791
00:35:29,559 --> 00:35:31,280
If you ever need anything, Mr. Long,

792
00:35:31,559 --> 00:35:33,599
I, Ma Jingrong, will do everything I can.

793
00:35:33,679 --> 00:35:35,400
Mr. Long saved my life, too.

794
00:35:35,679 --> 00:35:36,719
If you ever need help in the future,

795
00:35:37,000 --> 00:35:37,599
just say the word.

796
00:35:38,199 --> 00:35:39,280
You don't need to be so polite.

797
00:35:39,760 --> 00:35:41,400
You and Xiaoyi grew up together,

798
00:35:41,679 --> 00:35:42,639
so consider it fate.

799
00:35:43,480 --> 00:35:44,199
How about this?

800
00:35:44,360 --> 00:35:45,239
I'll host a get-together

801
00:35:45,400 --> 00:35:46,920
and invite everyone. How does that sound?

802
00:35:47,119 --> 00:35:49,960
Sounds great. I love a lively gathering.

803
00:35:50,960 --> 00:35:52,679
The patient is waiting for you all to finish.

804
00:35:53,000 --> 00:35:55,280
Brother Ma, take Sister-in-law home right away.

805
00:35:55,360 --> 00:35:56,119
Get some rest.

806
00:35:57,320 --> 00:35:57,840
And one more thing.

807
00:35:58,199 --> 00:35:59,280
The doctor said

808
00:35:59,400 --> 00:36:00,440
the baby is fine.

809
00:36:00,679 --> 00:36:01,639
Just rest for a few days and she'll be okay.

810
00:36:02,119 --> 00:36:03,199
When did the doctor...

811
00:36:05,960 --> 00:36:07,039
Really, Siqi?

812
00:36:19,079 --> 00:36:20,039
Lemonade

813
00:36:37,000 --> 00:36:37,840
What are you thinking about?

814
00:36:39,039 --> 00:36:39,719
Nothing.

815
00:36:47,760 --> 00:36:48,880
Do you...

816
00:36:50,119 --> 00:36:51,559
not want this baby?

817
00:37:00,199 --> 00:37:02,119
I know you've always wanted

818
00:37:02,119 --> 00:37:03,440
a child of your own.

819
00:37:03,599 --> 00:37:05,199
But the life we're living now...

820
00:37:05,199 --> 00:37:06,320
Our life right now...

821
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:07,960
really isn't fit for a child.

822
00:37:08,840 --> 00:37:09,880
Still, we have no idea

823
00:37:09,880 --> 00:37:11,760
when this kind of life

824
00:37:11,760 --> 00:37:12,840
will ever come to an end.

825
00:37:14,440 --> 00:37:15,960
I think Ge Xiaobai is right.

826
00:37:16,920 --> 00:37:18,920
Just because we feel we're not ready

827
00:37:19,679 --> 00:37:21,039
doesn't mean we should deny this baby

828
00:37:21,039 --> 00:37:22,320
the chance to come into this world.

829
00:37:24,760 --> 00:37:25,440
Then I might...

830
00:37:26,519 --> 00:37:27,880
not be a good father.

831
00:37:28,840 --> 00:37:30,920
Even if you're not a good father,

832
00:37:31,320 --> 00:37:33,119
I can be a good mother.

833
00:37:33,119 --> 00:37:34,079
Even if it's just by myself,

834
00:37:34,079 --> 00:37:35,400
I can still raise him.

835
00:37:40,280 --> 00:37:41,559
What I mean is,

836
00:37:42,960 --> 00:37:44,559
