837
00:37:45,119 --> 00:37:46,679
I don't want to lose him.

838
00:37:47,119 --> 00:37:47,960
I don't want...

839
00:37:49,840 --> 00:37:51,599
I don't want to just give up on him.

840
00:37:53,960 --> 00:37:54,679
Since

841
00:37:57,639 --> 00:37:59,119
Heaven gave him to us,

842
